{
  "total_ms": 66760,
  "total_chars": 284,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "帮邻居接了一次孩子，后来天天都成了您的活儿；哪天您说有事，对方反倒不高兴了——好心，怎么就帮成了应该的？",
      "chars": 52,
      "speech_ms": 11140,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 11140,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "老话说，人善被人欺。",
      "chars": 10,
      "speech_ms": 2310,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 11540,
      "end_ms": 13850,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "可善良不等于没底线。",
      "chars": 10,
      "speech_ms": 1990,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14250,
      "end_ms": 16240,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "《被遗忘的后半句》第一章第10条写着：宁可人负我，切莫我负人。",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 6810,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 16640,
      "end_ms": 23450,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "很多人把这句听成劝老实人忍着，我看不是。",
      "chars": 20,
      "speech_ms": 4130,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 27980,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "它说的是修养：别人负我，是他的事；我不负人，是我守的底线。",
      "chars": 29,
      "speech_ms": 6520,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 28380,
      "end_ms": 34900,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "可它从没说过，负我的人，我还得接着帮。",
      "chars": 19,
      "speech_ms": 3950,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 35300,
      "end_ms": 39250,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A08",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "善良的牙齿就在这儿：第一次帮是情分，对方得寸进尺，就当场把话说清——这次帮完，下次请提前安排；",
      "chars": 47,
      "speech_ms": 11370,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 39650,
      "end_ms": 51020,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A09",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "不吵不闹，但这个忙，到此为止。",
      "chars": 15,
      "speech_ms": 3250,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 51420,
      "end_ms": 54670,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A10",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这本书我放在主页橱窗里了，点开我主页，商品橱窗里就有。",
      "chars": 27,
      "speech_ms": 6140,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 55070,
      "end_ms": 61210,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A11",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您有没有帮着帮着、帮成应该的？后来是怎么收的场？",
      "chars": 24,
      "speech_ms": 4730,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 61610,
      "end_ms": 66340,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}